  "question": {
    "text": "<strong>Paragraph:</strong>\nA fair die is tossed repeatedly until a six is obtained. Let $X$ denotes the number of tosses required.<strong>Question:</strong>\nThe conditional probability that $X \\geq 6$ given $X>3$ equals",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "TXZ8d",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{125}{216}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "eiOAl",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{25}{216}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "CUugx",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{5}{36}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LTGLO",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{25}{36}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$P((X \\geq 6) /(X>3))$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\frac{P((X>3) /(X \\geq 6)) \\cdot P(X \\geq 6)}{P(X>3)} \\\\\n& =\\frac{1 \\cdot\\left[\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)^5 \\cdot \\frac{1}{6}+\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)^6 \\cdot \\frac{1}{6}+\\ldots \\infty\\right]}{\\left[\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)^3 \\cdot \\frac{1}{6}+\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)^4 \\cdot \\frac{1}{6}+\\ldots \\infty\\right]}=\\frac{25}{36} \\\\\n&\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
